//www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5430.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"幸せは、いつもあなたの足元にある","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5431.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"昨日は今日のために、今日は明日のために","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5432.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"出会いがあるから別れがある、別れがあるから出会いも生まれる","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5425.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"見ようとしている人にしか、それは見えない","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5434.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"小さなことは気にしない","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5426.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"心の掃除の上手な人になりたい","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5424.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"私は、いったい何者なんだろう","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/4694.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"勇者とは、勇気を与えてくれる人","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/4713.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"怒ったらダメ!","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/4712.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"調子に乗ると後が怖い","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/4714.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"ちょっと待ってと、止める勇気を!","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/4715.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"いい時もあれば悪い時もある","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/4693.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","same_site":true,"text":"目標がないと道に迷う","text_kind":"text","url":"https://www.city.ena.lg.jp/ichijou/5420.html"},{"is_pdf":false,"region":"other","sa